#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The password strength meter gives an indication of the security of the "
"password you have entered.  To improve the strength of the password, try:\n"
" - using a longer password;\n"
" - using a mixture of upper- and lower-case letters;\n"
" - using numbers or symbols, such as #, as well as letters."
msgstr ""
"La barra de resisténcia dels senhals balha una indicacion sus la seguretat "
"del senhal qu'avètz picat. Per melhorar la resisténcia del senhal, "
"ensajatz :\n"
" - d'utilizar un senhal mai long ;\n"
" - d'utilizar una mescla de letras minusculas e majusculas ;\n"
" - d'utilizar de nombres o de simbòls, coma « # », tant plan coma de letras."

